{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02854","headline":"途中述怀 · 李百药","name":"途中述怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伯喈迁塞北，亭伯之辽东。\n伊余何爲客，独守云台中。\n途遥已日暮，时泰道斯穷。\n拔心悲岸草，半死落岩桐。\n目送衡阳雁，情伤江上枫。\n福兮良所伏，今也信难通。\n丈夫自有志，宁伤官不公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李百药","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02854.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02854","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}